# Scope

This project is a custom WordPress plugin.

- Only edit files in this plugin repository.
- Never modify WordPress core, themes, or other plugins.
- Prefer minimal, targeted changes.
- Preserve existing architecture unless explicitly asked to refactor.
- Explain which files will change before making significant edits.

# WordPress standards

- Sanitize input.
- Escape output.
- Check capabilities and nonces where relevant.
- Use hooks/filters/actions in a WordPress-native way.